<title>UK: Ghana cocoa purchases at 642 t in 24th wk of '96/7.</title>
<headline>Ghana cocoa purchases at 642 t in 24th wk of '96/7.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana cocoa purchases totalled 642 tonnes in the 24th week of the 1996/7 crop year ending March 27, the Ghana Cocoa Board said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The cumulative amount was 299,121 tonnes.</p>
<p>Those figures compare with 3,331 tonnes a year ago in the 25th week ending March 28. The cumulative then was 344,915 tonnes.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8072</p>
</text>
